1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
In the name of God,

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
A message from the Master of the Universe

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A message from the Master of the Universe

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The Master of the Universe

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
I would like to talk about so many things,

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,000
because wherever one goes,

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Europe, India, Australia or America,

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
one finds more or less the same human problems.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Most human beings in the world

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,000
are so concerned about the world,

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
so confused and living a contradictory life.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
They are thoroughly unhappy,

14
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:11,000
utterly miserable and in a great deal of sorrow.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
And one's life seems to be a battlefield

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
from the moment you are born till you die.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:31,000
One finds right through the world

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,000
division, nationalistic, linguistic,

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,000
religious differences,

20
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
one sect opposed to another,

21
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,000
one way against another,

22
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
each saying its way is the best,

23
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,000
and the only one, and so on.

24
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:07,000
There is division, conflict and war.

25
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
There is division as the business world,

26
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,000
the spiritual world, the religious world,

27
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:22,000
the scientific world,

28
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,000
all the professorial college world.

29
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Seeing all this division,

30
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:38,000
this utter chaos

31
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,000
and great deal of misery,

32
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
one wonders,

33
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,000
and I am sure you do too,

34
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
what is one to do?

35
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,000
What course of action to be followed?

36
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
The left, the centre or the right?

37
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Or is it a course of action

38
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:22,000
dictated by some ideology,

39
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:25,000
some belief,

40
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
some authoritarian dictum?

41
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Or must one follow a course of action

42
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:43,000
that doesn't depend on any authority whatsoever,

43
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:48,000
neither the left, the centre nor the right,

44
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,000
nor or any other authority,

45
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:58,000
or any guru, any teacher, any priest,

46
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,000
or follow any organised religion,

47
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Catholic, Protestant, what you will,

48
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:14,000
but follow one's own inclination, tendency,

49
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:20,000
or follow one's own experience and knowledge,

50
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:27,000
self-reliant, confident and purposeful?

51
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:37,000
There is so much contradiction,

52
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:42,000
not only outwardly but also inwardly.

53
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:50,000
And what is one to do?

54
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:55,500
And I am sure you must

55
00:04:55,500 --> 00:05:00,000
have asked this question many times.

56
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:05,000
The more serious one is,

57
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
the more earnest,

58
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:10,000
and not seeking entertainment,

59
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:17,000
one must have really deeply asked this question,

60
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:20,000
confronted by a world that is so chaotic,

61
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:24,000
contradictory, divided,

62
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:34,000
knowing very well that one has lost faith,

63
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:38,000
having no trust in anybody,

64
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:46,000
no teacher, no professor,

65
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:52,000
no priest or authoritarian utopia.

66
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,000
If you are at all serious,

67
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:05,000
and I hope you are at least for this afternoon,

68
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:13,000
you must have not only asked,

69
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,000
such a question of yourself,

70
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:32,000
but also have found a responding answer to the challenge.

71
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,000
What is one to do?

72
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:42,000
Not having faith in another,

73
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:51,000
not being dependent on some saviour,

74
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:56,000
some teacher, some authority,

75
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:02,000
then where are you to look for light,

76
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,000
for an understanding?

77
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:09,000
What we are trying to do

78
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:12,000
is to find out for ourselves,

79
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,000
confronted with this extraordinary problem of living,

80
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:23,000
with all its contradictions and complexities,

81
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:27,000
what is the course of action

82
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,000
which will not be contradictory,

83
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:39,000
which will be whole, complete,

84
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:45,000
which will not produce more agonies,

85
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:49,000
more mischief, more confusion.

86
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:58,000
And to find that out,

87
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:02,000
is our problem.

88
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
And I think that is the only problem in life,

89
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:11,000
an action that is not broken up,

90
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
that is not contradictory,

91
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:22,000
that is continuous, whole, complete and total,

92
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,000
so that it doesn't bring

93
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,000
more sorrow, more confusion.

94
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,000
And if you will,

95
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,000
we will go together into this question,

96
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,000
bearing in mind that the speaker

97
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
has no authority whatsoever,

98
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:55,000
because both of us are going to examine

99
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:02,000
observe this phenomenon called life, living,

100
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,000
and find out the truth of the matter,

101
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,000
if there is an action,

102
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
a way of living,

103
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:18,000
not at odd moments or in a great crisis,

104
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:23,000
but every day, every minute,

105
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
a way of living

106
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,000
in which there is joy,

107
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,000
there is no violence,

108
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
no brutality,

109
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,000
no contradiction,

110
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:49,000
and obviously no imitation,

111
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,000
and dependency.

112
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:59,000
Unless we find such a way of living,

113
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,000
not an abstract idea,

114
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:08,000
a philosophical concept,

115
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,000
a theory,

116
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:19,000
but rather an actual way of living.

117
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:29,000
Whether there can be an action

118
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:34,000
so complete, so whole,

119
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:43,000
so completely non-contradictory.

120
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,000
And I feel

121
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:01,000
to live that way is the only religious way,

122
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,000
none other.

123
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,000
We are using the word religion

124
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:18,000
not in the accepted sense of that word,

125
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:23,000
which is to believe in something,

126
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:29,000
believe in god or no god,

127
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
or believe in some conceptual ideation.

128
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:41,000
We are using that word,

129
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:46,000
a way of life

130
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:50,000
in which every action

131
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
is whole,

132
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:57,000
complete and full of ecstasy.

133
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:01,000
Now we are going to go into that.

134
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
First of all,

135
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:07,000
to understand all this,

136
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,000
we must establish

137
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:14,000
right relationship between us.

138
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Between you and the speaker.

139
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,000
He is not teaching you,

140
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,000
in the ordinary sense of that word,

141
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,000
