142
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,000
telling you what to do.

143
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:46,000
The word teach

144
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:50,000
is to give information,

145
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
to make one understand,

146
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
to point out,

147
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,000
to inform.

148
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:11,000
And

149
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:16,000
one can teach mathematics,

150
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:21,000
give you some info,

151
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,000
scientific information.

152
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,000
But here,

153
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,000
there is no teacher.

154
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,000
And I really,

155
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,000
and we really mean it.

156
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:39,000
Because each one of us

157
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,000
has to be his own teacher

158
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
and his own disciple.

159
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,000
And this is a very serious matter.

160
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,000
So that

161
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,000
you are listening

162
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
with quite a different attitude.

163
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:12,000
You are listening

164
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
to the speaker,

165
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,000
to the words he is using,

166
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,000
and using

167
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:26,000
and understanding those words,

168
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:31,000
watching through those words

169
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,000
all your own inner self,

170
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,000
all your own reactions

171
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,000
and responses

172
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,000
and conditioning.

173
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
So that you yourself,

174
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
through your own observation,

175
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,000
learn.

176
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
So the speaker

177
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,000
becomes a mirror

178
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,000
in which you are observing yourself.

179
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,000
So, our relationship

180
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,000
between you and the speaker

181
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,000
is of

182
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:17,000
a basic communication.

183
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
Communication being

184
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
sharing together,

185
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,000
understanding together,

186
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,000
working together,

187
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
that is what the word

188
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
communication means,

189
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,000
to commune.

190
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,000
So,

191
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,000
seeing all that,

192
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,000
not as a theory,

193
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,000
not something that is extraneous to you,

194
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,000
but actually,

195
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,000
that is your life.

196
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Your daily contradiction,

197
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,000
your daily battle,

198
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,000
your daily irritations,

199
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:17,000
anger, hatred, brutality.

200
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
And to say,

201
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,000
if all that can end,

202
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
if all that can end,

203
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,000
if all that can end,

204
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,000
if all that can end,

205
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,000
then I will not be able

206
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,000
to live

207
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,000
a life that is free.

208
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,000
So that we can live

209
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:41,000
a quite a different kind of life.

210
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
A life that is free.

211
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:48,000
A life that doesn't bring

212
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:50,000
through action misery.

213
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,000
A life that is

214
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,000
really,

215
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,000
completely,

216
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,000
totally peaceful.

217
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,000
A life that is completely,

218
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,000
completely,

219
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,000
completely,

220
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,000
completely,

221
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,000
completely,

222
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,000
completely,

223
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,000
completely,

224
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,000
completely,

225
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,000
completely,

226
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,000
completely,

227
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,000
completely.

228
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,000
So,

229
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,000
when you ask,

230
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,000
observing all this,

231
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,000
what is one to do,

232
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,000
knowing

233
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,000
that you are the society,

234
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
and the society is you,

235
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:35,420
And the world is you, which is

236
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:40,840
not just an idea but a fact.

237
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:46,440
You have created this world by

238
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:52,040
your greed, anger, ambition, competition, violence.

239
00:17:52,040 --> 00:17:58,860
Inwardly you are that, and outwardly you are wars.

240
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:02,550
Of all these divisions, the black and the white

241
00:18:02,550 --> 00:18:06,240
and the pink and the blue and all the

242
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:20,620
rest of it, prejudice, antagonism, brutality.

243
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:32,280
We know this.

244
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:40,349
Either you know it as an

245
00:18:40,349 --> 00:18:48,419
