248
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:06,280
Or you have observed it in yourself.

249
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:10,620
You have seen it in yourself completely.

250
00:19:10,620 --> 00:19:15,289
Therefore there is no need for another

251
00:19:15,289 --> 00:19:19,959
to tell you what the world is like.

252
00:19:19,959 --> 00:19:24,349
You don't have to read a single

253
00:19:24,349 --> 00:19:28,740
