259
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:45,760
The question is what to do.

260
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:51,980
Because one realises what one is.

261
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:58,720
One is confused, as the world is.

262
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:11,560
One lives in contradiction, in division, as the world is.

263
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:17,200
