276
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:27,370
To what political party you should join, to

277
00:21:27,370 --> 00:21:32,340
what group, the pacifist and so on, to what

278
00:21:32,340 --> 00:21:36,580
group, to what section.

279
00:21:36,580 --> 00:21:40,470
So you are putting the

280
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:44,360
world as something outside of you.

281
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:48,370
But when one realises, not verbally, not as

282
00:21:48,370 --> 00:21:52,380
an idea, but as a reality, that the world

283
00:21:52,400 --> 00:22:00,090
is something, but actually, when one realises

284
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:07,780
that one is the world, and one's responsibility

285
00:22:07,780 --> 00:22:15,090
to the world is the

286
00:22:15,090 --> 00:22:22,400
